\def\@LN@column{1}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Discovery-sequence timeline from the original contaminated contrast through diagnosis, confirmation, and validation. The original analysis reported 70.78\% balanced accuracy, invalidated once its class label was found to conflate four marker types. A composition-arithmetic diagnostic fit 13 of 13 prior effects (R1(a)); a direct encode-vs-test decode reached 0.8668 balanced accuracy against a pre-registered 0.85 threshold (R1(b)), confirming the account. The corrected contrast (R2) yields a pre-calibration balanced accuracy of 0.5737, validated by four independent checks (C1/C3/C4/D2; see Supplementary Table S1).}}{8}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:1}{{1}{8}{Discovery-sequence timeline from the original contaminated contrast through diagnosis, confirmation, and validation. The original analysis reported 70.78\% balanced accuracy, invalidated once its class label was found to conflate four marker types. A composition-arithmetic diagnostic fit 13 of 13 prior effects (R1(a)); a direct encode-vs-test decode reached 0.8668 balanced accuracy against a pre-registered 0.85 threshold (R1(b)), confirming the account. The corrected contrast (R2) yields a pre-calibration balanced accuracy of 0.5737, validated by four independent checks (C1/C3/C4/D2; see Supplementary Table S1)}{figure.1}{}}
